Jira Link: [DB-1837](https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-1837)
### Description

When alter_universe_replication is used to setup replication for multiple tables along with bootstrapIds, only one of the streams is transitioned to 'ACTIVE' state. The remaining streams remain in 'INITIATED' state.

When bootstrap_cdc_producer is run for a set of tables, it internally creates CDC streams in 'INITIATED' state. Subsequently when alter_universe_replication is run for the tables, at the end of setting up the CDC streams, the streams are transitioned to an ACTIVE state. This is done by the UpdateCDCStream RPC for a given stream.

When multiple tables are involved in the ALTER, UpdateCDCStream is being invoked on a successful completion callback only after all the tables have setup their CDC streams.  In the ALTER case, this is invoked because the UpdateCDCStream is invoked upon successful completion of ALTER on all the tables, however the on success callback is associated with only 1 table/stream, so  only 1 stream gets transitioned to ACTIVE state.

Repro steps included below:

yba --master_addresses 127.0.0.1 bootstrap_cdc_producer 

~/code/yugabyte-db>yba --master_addresses 127.0.0.1 bootstrap_cdc_producer 000033e100003000800000000000400f,000033e1000030008000000000004014,000033e1000030008000000000004019
table id: 000033e100003000800000000000400f, CDC bootstrap id: b77d6f771edd4ca985c23cd9c89abb70
table id: 000033e1000030008000000000004014, CDC bootstrap id: b4ec320204b94301b83398dfa5fbb13e
table id: 000033e1000030008000000000004019, CDC bootstrap id: 8544e09c4105483a9749fdd1c57cd8a3
~/code/yugabyte-db>yba --master_addresses 127.0.0.2 setup_universe_replication 0f9cdac7-0e2c-4861-9f90-6f578871751e 127.0.0.1 000033e100003000800000000000400f b77d6f771edd4ca985c23cd9c89abb70
Replication setup successfully
~/code/yugabyte-db>**yba --master_addresses 127.0.0.2 alter_universe_replication 0f9cdac7-0e2c-4861-9f90-6f578871751e add_table 000033e1000030008000000000004014,000033e1000030008000000000004019 b4ec320204b94301b83398dfa5fbb13e,8544e09c4105483a9749fdd1c57cd8a3**
Replication altered successfully
